### API Sağlık Kontrolü
GET http://localhost:8080/health
Accept: application/json

### Gizli Sistem Durumu (/_hz/bfe1)
GET http://localhost:8080/_hz/bfe1
Accept: application/json

### Admin Kullanıcı Girişi (Login)
# @name login
POST http://localhost:8080/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "seed.dalga@ddo-case.invalid",
  "password": "Sifrem12345"
}

### Admin Profilini Getir (Token gerektirir)
GET http://localhost:8080/api/auth/me
Authorization: Bearer {{login.response.body.access_token}}

### Şubeleri Listele
GET http://localhost:8080/api/queue/branches
Accept: application/json
